{"id":"vod_sn_36047","vodId":"36047","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"猫眼三姐妹第二季","name_cn":"猫眼三姐妹第二季","date":"1984-01-01","year":"1984","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/790b2ea5587a98f69cd88060df4bf263.jpg"},"summary":"猫眼三姐妹是专门窃取美术作品的盗贼集团，她们作案时总会留下带有猫眼三姐妹字样的卡片。被猫眼三姐妹所盗的美术作品都属于她们失散多年的父亲海因茨（一位著名的艺术收藏家）所拥有。犬鸣警察署刑警内海俊夫负责调查猫眼三姐妹的案子，但是逮捕行动却一次又一次因猫眼三姐妹逍遥法外而失败。来生瞳是内海俊夫的女友，经营一家同样名为“猫眼”的咖啡厅。内海俊夫却不知道，来生瞳即是猫眼三姐妹之一……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:39:54","playable":true,"episodeCount":37,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/scp0TjxUHT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YpgBJ1Bzmh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bz9S3Zipzm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c90X9fkn8D1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DjjM742STD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZFTjFwYLvJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/45aaaCVY1P1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/E1sVxUesyM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xV2wWnXG5M1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/t5pqzztR9V1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/p20uzzKgM91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/r4ynUqRES41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qqVUYzjLLW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DB9zm8RuHW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8NcSmKcQQs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"